  "headline": "Carvedilol is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale General has 19.5 days on hand and the labeler plant Bryant Ranch Prepack was classified VAI 2026-07-16",
  "headline_cites": ["D2", "D1", "E11"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show carvedilol is not on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 283 tablets of carvedilol 25 mg at 14.5 tablets per day, providing 19.5 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label for NDC 71335247403 names Bryant Ranch Prepack as the labeler and plant (FEI 1000519407).",
      "cites": ["E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1326578 of that plant ended 2026-07-16 and was classified VAI, with the classification known 2026-10-14.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earlier inspections of the same plant include an OAI classification in 2009 and multiple VAI classifications through 2024.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to Bryant Ranch PrePack on 2010-04-08.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based alternate manufacturer option ranked 3 is to buy from Advagen Pharma Limited, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    }
  ]
}
